@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:收到典狱长的通知后，<br>少女们被召集到会客厅。|#0103Adv18_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听到汉娜死亡的消息，<br>梅露露大哭起来，不断地抽噎。|#0103Adv18_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉躺在沙发上，<br>一脸茫然。|#0103Adv18_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙蜷缩在墙角，显得十分消沉。|#0103Adv18_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可目光呆滞，似乎在和谁对话。|#0103Adv18_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格低着头。|#0103Adv18_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……说起来……<br>　奈叶香去哪里了呢）|#0103Adv18_Ema001|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛恍惚间想着。|#0103Adv18_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; フクロウの羽ばたき音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_8 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:5_2

[PrintTextModified Text:这时，随着天花板边上传来一阵翅膀拍动的声音，<br>典狱长现身了。|#0103Adv18_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:唉，又来了……又是凶杀案……<br>而且还是大清早……真希望能考虑下时间啊……|#0103Adv18_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那么……<br>【魔女审判】就定在正午举行吧。|#0103Adv18_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么总是随便定时间啊！？|#0103Adv18_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:这可是经过深思熟虑的。<br>为了让大家尽可能被逼入绝境……不不，<br>是为了让大家明天也能愉快地生活。|#0103Adv18_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不愉快的事情还是赶快解决比较好，<br>对吧？|#0103Adv18_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:请各位务必从在场的囚犯之中锁定杀人凶手的身份。<br>选中的人将以【魔女】的身份被处以死刑……<br>还有就是老规矩，如果无法锁定凶手，所有人都要接受处刑。|#0103Adv18_Warden005| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，顺带一提，【火精之室】的灭火工作<br>已经出动全体监视猫头鹰去完成了。<br>真是费了不少功夫……|#0103Adv18_Warden006| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:请各位好好搜查，<br>尽力找出凶手吧。|#0103Adv18_Warden007| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; フクロウの羽ばたき音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_8 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:它刚才是不是说“尽力”？<br>怎么感觉越来越随便了？|#0103Adv18_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:不知道这座监牢存在多久了，<br>也许连它都厌倦了<br>这种凶杀案和魔女审判的流程吧……|#0103Adv18_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但对我们来说，<br>这可不是能随便了事的事情。|#0103Adv18_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛她们好一阵子都留在了原地，<br>一动不动。|#0103Adv18_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（说什么搜查……我根本就做不到……）|#0103Adv18_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:此时，<br>玛格最先行动，打破了现状。|#0103Adv18_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:既然是凶杀案，<br>就必须找出凶手。<br>否则，所有人都会死。|#0103Adv18_Margo003| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格轻声说完，<br>离开了会客厅。|#0103Adv18_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:接着，可可和亚里沙也慢慢地走了出去。|#0103Adv18_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉也从沙发上下来。|#0103Adv18_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉小姐，你现在的状态不适合活动……|#0103Adv18_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:我可是名侦探哦？<br>怎么可能坐视不管……|#0103Adv18_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:可能是因为没站稳，<br>雪莉的身体摇晃了一下。<br>梅露露急忙扶住她。|#0103Adv18_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:请你好好休息……！<br>要是雪莉小姐也出什么事的话……|#0103Adv18_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不要。就算要爬着我也要调查……|#0103Adv18_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露，<br>带雪莉去医务室吧。|#0103Adv18_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

; ＠備考◆抗議っぽく

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛！|#0103Adv18_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:如果这真的是凶杀案的话……不，<br>就算不是，我也必须查明<br>汉娜死亡的真相。|#0103Adv18_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这是为了汉娜。|#0103Adv18_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛平静地说完，<br>头也不回地离开了会客厅。|#0103Adv18_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

